  <!-- EN: Large Plasma Thrower -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Plasma1_L.label>大型等离子发射器</GR_MechWeapon_Plasma1_L.label>
  <!-- EN: A weapon that fires devastating high-energy plasma spheres. These plasma projectiles are especially effective against the armor of large ships. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Plasma1_L.description>可以向目标发射毁灭性的高能等离子球体的武器。这种等离子抛射体在对付大型舰船的装甲时特别有效。</GR_MechWeapon_Plasma1_L.description>
