  <GR_MechWeapon_Plasma2_L.label>大型等离子加速器</GR_MechWeapon_Plasma2_L.label>
  <!-- EN: This new accelerator cannon fires high-energy plasma held by more advanced confinement fields. The technology reduces the energy lost as the plasma travels toward its target. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Plasma2_L.description>这种新的加速炮利发射具有更先进约束场的高能等离子体。这种技术可以降低等离子体向目标飞行过程中所逸散的能量。</GR_MechWeapon_Plasma2_L.description>
